WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Install and offline. Install Flow as an app, and read pages you've opened even when you're offline.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: desk app; commute.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:28.070
Install Flow from Settings, and it opens in its own window.

4
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:33.680
Offline, pages you've opened before still load…

5
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:45.570
…but changes need a connection, and say so straight away.

6
00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:51.570
No install option: Some browsers hide it; use the browser menu's “Install” or “Add to Home Screen”. A change failed with “You're offline”: Reconnect and try again; nothing was queued.

7
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Installable on desktop and mobile
